ves the docks and monitors in two POs, which does not meet your single-PO request.\n3. **Leave it as is** while the supplier issue is investigated.\n\nI have not placed any new orders or cancellations. Once you confirm an option, I'll carry it out and report the result.", "type": "text"}]}]}